            <p>For a stronger check, compare the SHA-256 checksum of the file
            {{ telechargements.kit('msixbundle').fichier }} (PowerShell:
            <code>Get-FileHash .\{{ telechargements.kit('msixbundle').fichier }}</code>):
            <code>{{ telechargements.kit('msixbundle').sha256 }}</code></p>
            <p><strong>3. Understand the permission shown.</strong> If Windows displays
