            Apps → Installed apps → search for “AZERTY Global” → Uninstall
            (Windows 10: Apps → Apps &amp; features).</p>
            <h4>EXE installer</h4>
            <p><span class="insecable"><kbd>Win</kbd> + <kbd>I</kbd></span> → Time &amp; language →
